# Keycloak user exports ARE committed, but only after sanitize-realms.sh has
# replaced every password credential with the ${IMPORT_KC_DEV_PASSWORD}
# placeholder — a raw export carries argon2 password hashes and must never land
# here. The scan in sanitize-realms.sh fails loud if a real credential survives.
#
# Nothing is ignored in this directory today. If you export by hand, run
# sanitize-realms.sh BEFORE staging.
